{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8be8abb0-db0e-11ef-8f05-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8be8ab8b-db0e-11ef-8705-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":1,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"藍臺","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉國","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋国","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab8e-db0e-11ef-8da1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：有勞定國曰襄。爲政，爲晉國之政。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：有劳定国曰襄。为政，为晋国之政。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab8d-db0e-11ef-9e7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韓康子","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩康子","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab91-db0e-11ef-a031-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓宣子","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩宣子","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab92-db0e-11ef-b38e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"莊子","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄子","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab93-db0e-11ef-aacd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏桓子","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏桓子","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab94-db0e-11ef-bf18-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏獻子","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏献子","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab95-db0e-11ef-a69f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"曼多","people_name_jianti_auto":"曼多","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab96-db0e-11ef-88c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"駒","people_name_jianti_auto":"驹","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab97-db0e-11ef-9e97-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"韓康子，韓宣子之曾孫莊子之子虔虎也。魏桓子，魏獻子之子曼多之孫駒也。諡法：溫柔好樂曰康；辟土服遠曰桓。爾雅：四方而高曰臺。","note_content_jianti_auto":"韩康子，韩宣子之曾孙庄子之子虔虎也。魏桓子，魏献子之子曼多之孙驹也。谥法：温柔好乐曰康；辟土服远曰桓。尔雅：四方而高曰台。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab90-db0e-11ef-89a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"段","people_name_jianti_auto":"段","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab9b-db0e-11ef-8ac6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭共叔段","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑共叔段","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab9c-db0e-11ef-9824-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜：段，鄭共叔段之後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱：段，郑共叔段之后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab9a-db0e-11ef-aff3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba0-db0e-11ef-a424-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本無「難」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本无「难」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab9f-db0e-11ef-bb07-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab9e-db0e-11ef-9d29-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba2-db0e-11ef-a0de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"春秋以來，大夫之家臣謂大夫曰主。難，乃旦翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春秋以来，大夫之家臣谓大夫曰主。难，乃旦翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba1-db0e-11ef-8a3f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"書·五子之歌之辭。夏，戶雅翻。見，賢遍翻，發見也，著也，形也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"书·五子之歌之辞。夏，户雅翻。见，贤遍翻，发见也，著也，形也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba3-db0e-11ef-a656-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"段規","people_name_jianti_auto":"段规","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba6-db0e-11ef-80cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓康子","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩康子","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba7-db0e-11ef-92ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"夫，音扶。段規，韓康子之相也。相，息醬翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"夫，音扶。段规，韩康子之相也。相，息酱翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba5-db0e-11ef-86f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋祁","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋祁","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba9-db0e-11ef-ab05-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","place_note":"府雍县，陕西凤翔","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8be8abaa-db0e-11ef-9f4b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋祁曰：蜹，如銳翻；又字林：人劣翻。秦人謂蚊爲蜹。今按：蜹，小蟲，日中羣集人之肌膚而嘬其血，蚊之類也。蜂，細腰而能螫人。蠆亦毒蟲，長尾，音丑邁翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋祁曰：蜹，如锐翻；又字林：人劣翻。秦人谓蚊为蜹。今按：蜹，小虫，日中群集人之肌肤而嘬其血，蚊之类也。蜂，细腰而能螫人。虿亦毒虫，长尾，音丑迈翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":160,"tongjian_id":"8be8aba8-db0e-11ef-8afb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8be8ab8b-db0e-11ef-8705-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"ruì","source_anchor_text":"乃不可乎蜹蟻蜂蠆皆","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":147,"text":"蜹","tongjian_id":"6e49d4c5-6e05-5bba-b663-2472eb174c39"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"藍臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓝台","resolved_place_entity_id":9031,"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8be8abb0-db0e-11ef-8f05-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"及智宣子卒，智襄子爲政，與韓康子、魏桓子宴於藍臺。智伯戲康子而侮段規。智國聞之，諫曰：「主不備難，難必至矣！」智伯曰：「難將由我。我不爲難，誰敢興之！」對曰：「不然。夏書有之：『一人三失，怨豈在明，不見是圖。』夫君子能勤小物，故無大患。今主一宴而恥人之君相，又弗備，曰『不敢興難』，無乃不可乎！蜹、蟻、蜂、蠆，皆能害人，況君相乎！」弗聽。","content_fanyi":"智宣子去世后，智襄子智瑶执掌国政，与韩康子、魏桓子在蓝台宴饮。席间智瑶戏弄韩康子，又羞辱韩康子的家相段规。智瑶的家臣智国听说后，进谏说：“主公如果不防备祸难，祸难一定会到来！”智瑶说：“祸难由我作主。我不降祸，谁敢发难！”智国回答说：“并非如此。《夏书》上有这样的话：‘一个人屡次犯错，怨仇岂会只在明处，应在尚未显现时就设法防备。’君子能够勤谨地对待小事，所以没有大的祸患。如今主公因一次宴饮就羞辱人家的国君与国相，又不加防备，还说‘他们不敢发难’，恐怕不可以吧！蚊子、蚂蚁、黄蜂、蝎子都能伤害人，何况是国君和国相呢！”智瑶不听。","content_jianti_auto":"及智宣子卒，智襄子为政，与韩康子、魏桓子宴于蓝台。智伯戏康子而侮段规。智国闻之，谏曰：「主不备难，难必至矣！」智伯曰：「难将由我。我不为难，谁敢兴之！」对曰：「不然。夏书有之：『一人三失，怨岂在明，不见是图。』夫君子能勤小物，故无大患。今主一宴而耻人之君相，又弗备，曰『不敢兴难』，无乃不可乎！蜹、蚁、蜂、虿，皆能害人，况君相乎！」弗听。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 威烈王 / 二十三年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8be8ab8b-db0e-11ef-8705-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-403},"tongjian_id":"8be8ab8b-db0e-11ef-8705-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"藍臺","resolved_profile":{"entity_id":9031,"entry_list_str":"藍臺","intro":"战国时期晋国的一处台名，为贵族宴饮之所，具体位置不详。","show_map":false,"standard_name":"蓝台","type_code":"other"}},"message":"success","success":true}